{"The path indexes metadata[\"sender\"][\"login\"], but integrations created by the setup pipeline do not add sender unless it was already in pipeline state. If such an existing integration has no org link, the validation raises KeyError and returns a 500 instead of the intended invalid-installation dialog.": 0.9187783598899841, "When GitHub sends an uninstall webhook, the Integration row remains with DISABLED status. The new ACTIVE lookup returns the generic invalid-installation page before setup can reach ensure_integration(), so reinstalling the same GitHub App cannot reactivate the existing integration.": 0.736525297164917}